      "title": "Pass 1 - native AV",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Pass 1 - H3 generates the audio\n\nNo `LoadAudio` anywhere. H3 is a single-stream DiT whose packed sequence is `[text | cond | audio | video]`, so it denoises the abyss visuals **and** the whale song jointly, attending across both. That joint attention is where the sync comes from.\n\nThe contest requires *H3-generated synced audio* - this is it."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
