      "widgets_values": [
        "Cinematic, hyper-detailed 8K macro-wide view inside a subterranean ocean abyss. The camera pushes in with slow, steady amplitude through a field of millions of floating bioluminescent micro-plankton glowing in soft cyan. A colossal cyber-organic leviathan whale glides forward from the dark indigo void, its skin patterned with intricate turquoise and violet neural bioluminescence channels. As the whale emits a deep harmonic song, the light channels across its throat and ventral pleats flare with intense pulse-reactive brightness, casting volumetric turquoise light beams through the crystalline water. Delicate glass jellyfish flash in rhythmic counterpoint, and pressure waves ripple the water on every low note.\n\nDeep resonant whale vocalizations, soothing sub-bass ocean rumble, ambient crystal glass harmonies, distant sonar pings.",
        672,
        384,
        124
      ],
