      "title": "Pass 2 - bass reactive",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Pass 2 - the bass drives the picture\n\n`H3 Audio Analyze` reads the soundtrack **H3 just wrote** and pulls the low band out of it. That curve becomes an animated mask, and the video is re-rendered through it.\n\n`audio_mode: preserve` zeroes the audio stream's noise mask, so the score is carried through pass 2 bit-exact - the reactive picture is locked to the exact audio that ships with the video.\n\nMasks are built at the latent's exact shape and **aggregated** per latent frame (H3 packs 1,4,4,4,4 source frames per 5 tokens), so a one-frame transient survives instead of being interpolated away."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
